@startuml
title Environment destinations and operation admission
[*] --> UNCONFIGURED
UNCONFIGURED --> CONFIGURED : explicit scoped READY selection + version CAS
CONFIGURED --> CONFIGURED : pre-runtime change / successful store copy\nversion CAS; no permanent lock
CONFIGURED --> TRANSITIONING : snapshot admission + persisted owner claim
TRANSITIONING --> CONFIGURED : successful cutover or compensated failure\nrelease owner; pinned generation
TRANSITIONING --> INTERRUPTED : process failure or unsafe compensation; retained claim/stage
INTERRUPTED --> CONFIGURED : explicit safe recovery\nprior execution confirmed stopped
note right of TRANSITIONING
Settings/config/draft writes return 409 busy.
Network calls outside DB transaction.
Source target and refs retained.
end note
note left of CONFIGURED
Preview pins versions + both destinations.
Stale Deploy rejected before side effects.
Different Environments operate independently.
end note
@enduml
